    <name>TinyXbox360BackupManager</name>
    <summary>Manage Xbox 360 game backups</summary>
    <developer id="fr.dechriste">
        <name>Jean-Matthieu Dechriste</name>
    </developer>
    <description>
        <p>You have a modded Xbox 360 running the Aurora dashboard and some game backups on your computer. This app copies them onto the console (or onto a USB drive) in the format it understands, without requiring you to know how any of it works.</p>
        <p>Features</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Drop in a game file and it figures out the type and prepares it automatically</li>
            <li>ISO to GOD conversion, and extraction of original Xbox titles</li>
            <li>Detects plugged-in USB drives and remote consoles, then suggests where games should go</li>
            <li>Box art downloaded automatically from XboxUnity</li>
            <li>Transfers over the network with FTP, straight to a USB drive, or onto the console's own hard drive plugged into the computer</li>
            <li>Title update and DLC management</li>
            <li>Native app written in Rust and Slint, no Electron</li>
        </ul>
        <p>TinyXbox360BackupManager is intended strictly for legal homebrew use and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft. Use of TinyXbox360BackupManager for pirated or unauthorized copies of games is strictly prohibited.</p>
    </description>
